        <li><a href="https://www.ilga.gov/legislation/ILCS/details?MajorTopic=&Chapter=&ActName=Illinois+Trust+Code.&ActID=4001&ChapterID=61&ChapAct=760+ILCS+3/&SeqStart=100000&SeqEnd=1700000" rel="noopener">760 ILCS 3/101 (Illinois Trust Code, Sec. 101 "Short title"); land trusts are common-law instruments with no enabling land-trust statute</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section-tight">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="upl-notice">
        <strong>Not legal advice.</strong>
        This information is for educational purposes based on publicly available statutes.
        Verify current requirements with a licensed Illinois attorney before signing or filing.
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
